'''Chroma Ornament''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that was obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 60,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2025|2025 Christmas Event]], or by [[trading]].

== Appearance ==
Chroma Ornament has a similar appearance to [[Ornament]], but it shifts colors constantly. Instead of the red that had been on the Ornament originally, it is replaced with various shifting colors.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the gun [[Chroma Bauble]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Bauble Set|Chroma Bauble Set]].
* It is the third [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] weapon obtainable through [[Gifts|gifting]], the others being [[Chroma Evergun]], and [[Chroma Bauble]].
* It is the chroma counterpart of the knife under the name [[Ornament]].
*As of now, it is the only weapon to lack an in-game icon.

